\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 For Python units:\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 target supported modern Python releases unless the unit requires historical comparison;\
identify CPython-specific behavior and relevant Python-version differences;\
use idiomatic, type-annotated Python;\
include required imports, pyproject.toml dependencies, and runnable commands when practical;\
